---------------------- A MC Soft Production -------------------------

   This program will create some bulletins using some of the data
   found in your userdata files.

   Bulletins created at the moment is: 

       o Top Callers
       o Top Downloaders
       o Top Uploaders
       o Top Credits
       o Top Message Writers
       o Top Private Message Writers
       o Top Public Message Writers

CONTENTS:
~~~~~~~~~
MCTop     - THE bulletin creator..
MCTop.DOC - This doc file.


USAGE: from CLI.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
MCTop [-l lines] [path]

[-l lines] - Number of users in the bulletins.
[path]     - Path to place the bulletins.


Example:

MCTop -l 15 gfiles:

Puts the bulletins in the 'gfiles:' directory, and uses 15 users in each
bulletin.

And the files created is:

MCTopMessy.txt
MCTopPriMessy.txt
MCTopPubMessy.txt
MCTopCreds.txt
MCTopCalls.txt
MCTopDl.txt
MCTopUp.txt

Ill think you can figure out what the files doing for yourself, so im
not gonne explain it.


